  data: {
    LLM: "Don't bluff! In traditional Púkk rules, it is actually illegal to 'Púkk' without at least a pair. However, you can 'Soft-Púkk' by betting small with a medium pair to induce others to fold. Prioritize the 'Pamfíll' for the Vying phase, but remember it has no special power in the Playing phase—use it as a normal Jack of Clubs to continue a sequence.\n\nBowl Farming: Pay attention to which bowls have the most chips. If the 'Ace' bowl hasn't been emptied for 5 rounds, it will be huge. If you hold an Ace, your primary goal in the Play phase should be to maneuver the sequence in that suit so that YOU get to play the Ace. This might mean keeping a 10 and Queen of that suit so you can jump in when someone plays the Jack.\n\nSequence Starvation: If you are the leader of a sequence, try to 'Kill' the suit as fast as possible by playing cards that gap the sequence (though you must follow rank if someone else has it). In the Play phase, if you hold the Pamfíll (Jack of Clubs), you know exactly where that Jack is. Use this knowledge to stop sequences in the Club suit effectively.",
    Player: "Don't bluff! In traditional Púkk rules, it is actually illegal to 'Púkk' without at least a pair. However, you can 'Soft-Púkk' by betting small with a medium pair to induce others to fold. Prioritize the 'Pamfíll' for the Vying phase, but remember it has no special power in the Playing phase—use it as a normal Jack of Clubs to continue a sequence.\n\nBowl Farming: Pay attention to which bowls have the most chips. If the 'Ace' bowl hasn't been emptied for 5 rounds, it will be huge. If you hold an Ace, your primary goal in the Play phase should be to maneuver the sequence in that suit so that YOU get to play the Ace. This might mean keeping a 10 and Queen of that suit so you can jump in when someone plays the Jack.\n\nSequence Starvation: If you are the leader of a sequence, try to 'Kill' the suit as fast as possible by playing cards that gap the sequence (though you must follow rank if someone else has it). In the Play phase, if you hold the Pamfíll (Jack of Clubs), you know exactly where that Jack is. Use this knowledge to stop sequences in the Club suit effectively.",
