    basic: "Don't bluff! In traditional Púkk rules, it is actually illegal to 'Púkk' without at least a pair. However, you can 'Soft-Púkk' by betting small with a medium pair to induce others to fold. Prioritize the 'Pamfíll' for the Vying phase, but remember it has no special power in the Playing phase—use it as a normal Jack of Clubs to continue a sequence.",
